#
# check-operator-permissions.sh (#3835): is ork's canonical deny payload present
# in a settings scope Claude Code actually ENFORCES? A plugin settings.json is
# inert (CC reads only agent/subagentStatusLine), so this walks the operator's
# real scopes: <project>/.claude/settings.local.json, <project>/.claude/settings.json,
# ~/.claude/settings.local.json, ~/.claude/settings.json.
#
# Usage: check-operator-permissions.sh [project_dir] [--json]
# Exit:  0 every payload rule present in >=1 enforcing scope
